   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "FICTION AND REALITY",
     "y": 697,
     "size": 29,
     "font": "typewriter-bold",
     "underline": 4,
     "underline_offset": 13,
     "x": 68
    },
    {
     "text": "WHAT WE SAW",
     "y": 761,
     "x": 68,
     "size": 23
    },
    {
     "text": "WHAT HAPPENED",
     "y": 761,
     "x": 489,
     "size": 23
    },
    {
     "para": "James Bond, Ian Fleming’s seductive spy.",
     "y": 815,
     "x": 68,
     "width": 385
    },
    {
     "para": "Fleming, a naval intelligence officer, crossed paths with real double agents. Dusko Popov may have been one of his models; historians debate it.",
     "y": 815,
     "x": 492,
     "width": 500
    },
    {
     "para": "The moles in John le Carré’s novels.",
     "y": 949,
     "x": 68,
     "width": 385
    },
    {
     "para": "Le Carré worked for MI5 and MI6. He saw up close the damage done by Kim Philby and the “Cambridge Five”.",
     "y": 949,
     "x": 492,
     "width": 500
    },
    {
     "para": "“The Americans”: a KGB couple in suburban Washington.",
     "y": 1059,
     "x": 68,
     "width": 385
    },
    {
     "para": "The series was born of the 2010 arrests. One of the ten said it showed exactly what an illegal lives through.",
     "y": 1060,
     "x": 492,
     "width": 500
    },
    {
     "para": "“The Bureau” and its agents under false identities.",
     "y": 1172,
     "x": 68,
     "width": 385
    },
    {
     "para": "In the jargon, a “legend” really is an agent’s invented life. Tuomi had to learn his by heart.",
     "y": 1172,
     "x": 492,
     "width": 500
    },
    {
     "para": "“Bridge of Spies”: a swap on a Berlin bridge.",
     "y": 1284,
     "x": 68,
     "width": 385
    },
    {
     "para": "In 1962, the Soviet spy Rudolf Abel, owner of the Brooklyn hollow coin, was swapped for the American pilot Gary Powers.",
     "y": 1284,
     "x": 492,
     "width": 500
    },
    {
     "text": "**Kaarlo Tuomi never got his own series.**",
     "y": 1437,
     "cx": 512,
     "size": 25
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}